<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>페이백 계좌 확인 | GOAT Arena</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/goat-arena.css" />
    <%- include("partials/rank-motion-head") %>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/images/favicon-32.png" />
  </head>
  <body class="goat-arena-page arena-inner-page">
    <%- include("partials/goat-arena-navigation", { activeArenaPage, arenaUser }) %>
    <main class="arena-page-main arena-account-confirm-main">
      <section class="arena-account-confirm-card">
        <p>PAYBACK ACCOUNT CHECK</p>
        <h1>계좌 정보를 마지막으로 확인해 주세요.</h1>
        <span>확인 후 저장하면 페이백 지급 대상이 되었을 때 운영자가 이 계좌로 지급할 수 있습니다.</span>
        <% if (error) { %><div class="arena-account-feedback is-error"><%= error %></div><% } %>
        <dl>
          <div><dt>은행</dt><dd><%= account.bankName %></dd></div>
          <div><dt>예금주</dt><dd><%= account.accountHolderName %></dd></div>
          <div><dt>계좌번호</dt><dd><%= account.accountNumber %></dd></div>
        </dl>
        <form method="post" action="/goat-arena/profile/payback-account/confirm">
          <input type="hidden" name="bankName" value="<%= account.bankName %>" />
          <input type="hidden" name="accountHolderName" value="<%= account.accountHolderName %>" />
          <input type="hidden" name="accountNumber" value="<%= account.accountNumber %>" />
          <label><input type="checkbox" name="accountConfirmed" value="1" /> <span>예금주와 계좌번호를 직접 확인했습니다.</span></label>
          <div><a href="/goat-arena/profile#payback-account">다시 입력</a><button type="submit">확인했습니다</button></div>
        </form>
      </section>
    </main>
  <%- include("partials/business-footer") %>
  </body>
</html>
